        {
          "year": 1933,
          "action": "vienna-family-childbirth/son-born",
          "text": "Life 03在Leopoldstädter Zinshaus, gemeinsamer Gang生下一个男婴，取名Friedrich 2。Hermann Stein 2把消息带到工厂，工友凑了几个克朗；家里把唯一的摇篮重新刷了一遍。"
        },
        {
